  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"5 left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis equals 15 left parenthesis x minus 17 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the sum of the solutions to the given equation?</p>",
